# The installer and the Android package, put here for the running server to hand out.
#
# The files are ignored by git (they are build output, and tens of megabytes of it); this
# directory is kept because `deploy/compose.yaml` mounts it over the image's own copy
# of `/app/ui/download`. Without the directory Docker would create it as root on first start,
# and with it empty the landing page simply shows no downloads — which is the honest answer
# to "has anything been built yet", not an error.
#
# See docs/DEPLOY.md for where the two files come from.
